# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# claude code (agent skills, local launch/permission config — machine-local)
.claude/

# local scratch backups
backups/
*.bak

# Built from assets/fonts/ by scripts/build-cjk-subset.mjs on every dev and
# build. Generated, so it is not committed - and it must not be, or a stale
# subset could outlive the copy it was cut for.
/app/fonts/*.woff2

# Working notes and the raw scrape lib/products.ts was transcribed from.
# Kept on disk, deliberately out of the repo: none of it ships.
PLAN.md
create-a-new-section-functional-kite.md
/data/

# Media in public/ that nothing references (~18 MB). Kept locally in case a
# section wants them later; if one gets used, un-ignore it here or it will be
# missing from the deploy.
#
# THIS HAS NOW BITTEN TWICE. Both times the same way: a file was listed here
# BECAUSE nothing referenced it, then a section was built that used it, and the
# list was never revisited. The build passes, the page is perfect locally, and
# the image 404s in production — the only thing wrong is that the file was
# never in the commit.
#
#   scratched-metal-background.jpg — /contact's banner, above the fold.
#   pexels-masoodaslami-29585706.jpg — the Vision half of /vision-mission.
#
# `git status` will NOT warn you: an ignored file is not untracked, it is
# invisible. Check against this list before putting a picture on a page.
/public/0_Fly_Silky_3840X2160.mp4
/public/hero.jpg
/public/about-1.png
/public/about-2.png
/public/logo-space.png
/public/white-staircase-with-shadows-wall.jpg
/public/pexels-antonio-sokic-1901950-3839430.jpg
